title Calibration2 - TOML Driven Calibration Workflow

participant User
participant Runner
participant EngineConfig
participant CaseConfig
participant ChronicleBuilder
participant CalibrationEngine
participant MethodsDispatcher
participant MethodImpl
participant CalibrationResults

User->Runner: execute run_calibration.py
Runner->EngineConfig: load_calibration_toml(config_calibration.toml)
EngineConfig->EngineConfig: validate_calibration_config_data()
EngineConfig-->Runner: validated config dict

Runner->CaseConfig: validate_*_chronicle_config(config["chronicle"])
CaseConfig-->Runner: normalized chronicle params
Runner->ChronicleBuilder: build synthetic chronicle
ChronicleBuilder-->Runner: observed series + forcing + true params

Runner->EngineConfig: resolve_calibration_settings(config, model_parameter_order)
EngineConfig-->Runner: objective_metric, method, bounds, method_kwargs

Runner->CalibrationEngine: initialize(observed, simulator, parameter_set, objective_metric)
Runner->CalibrationEngine: calibrate(method, **method_kwargs)
CalibrationEngine->MethodsDispatcher: calibrate(objective_cost, bounds, method, **kwargs)
MethodsDispatcher->MethodImpl: method(objective_cost, bounds, **kwargs)
MethodImpl-->MethodsDispatcher: method output dict
MethodsDispatcher-->CalibrationEngine: raw method output
CalibrationEngine->CalibrationResults: from_method_output(raw)
CalibrationResults-->CalibrationEngine: structured result
CalibrationEngine-->Runner: CalibrationResults

Runner->Runner: compute diagnostics + plotting
Runner-->User: summary + figure
